
# Changelog

All notable changes to FileServer are documented here.

The format follows Keep a Changelog.

## [1.0.0] - 2026-08-21

### Added

* User registration
* User authentication
* JWT authentication
* Remember Me support
* Google OAuth2 authentication
* Email verification
* Forgot password
* Password reset
* User profile management
* File upload
* File download
* Chunked file upload
* Resumable file upload
* File rename
* File move
* File search
* File sharing
* Folder creation
* Folder management
* Recycle Bin
* File restore
* Permanent deletion
* Billing
* Usage tracking
* Logger Management UI
* Configurable logger levels
* Debug logger support
* Telegram file storage
* Telegram logging
* SMTP email support
* Redis support
* PostgreSQL persistence
* Flyway migrations
* Bucket4j rate limiting
* Swagger/OpenAPI documentation
* Docker support
* Docker Compose support
* Production deployment documentation

### Security

* JWT-based authentication
* BCrypt password hashing
* Master-key protected administrative operations
* Remember Me token support
* Password reset tokens
* Google OAuth2
* Request rate limiting

### Documentation

* README
* API documentation
* Development guide
* Deployment guide
* Contribution guide
* Changelog
* MIT License
